OL,3,GNEWSAMajor disruption during urgent
OL,4,Atrain track repairs
OL,5,
OL,6,FTrain services are being cancelled and
OL,7,Fdelayed due to a track defect on a main
OL,8,Frail line.
OL,10,FNational Rail said urgent repairs were
OL,11,Fbeing carried out on Friday morning to
OL,12,Fthe track at Exeter St Davids, meaning
OL,13,F"all lines are blocked", with
OL,14,Fdisruption expected until 12:00 GMT and
OL,15,Fdelays of up to 60 minutes.
OL,17,FTrain services between Exeter St Davids
OL,18,Fand Plymouth via Newton Abbot may be
OL,19,Fcancelled, delayed or revised, as well
OL,20,Fas services into Cornwall, according to
OL,21,FGreat Western Railway (GWR).
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,345,340,200,160,0,100
